00:22:28.515 --> 00:22:30.183
Well, then I can at least raise the bed a little...

516
00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:32.485
(Lee Young) Don’t just tell me
Stay away!

517
00:22:50.938 --> 00:22:52.471
[Sound of door opening]

518
00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:55.441
[Sound of door closing]
[Lee Young sighs]

519
00:22:59.200 --> 00:23:01.200
[heavy music]

520
00:23:01.982 --> 00:23:03.350
[sigh]

521
00:23:03.417 --> 00:23:04.650
[sigh]

522
00:23:05.755 --> 00:23:06.886
(Do-won) Teacher Oh I-young

523
00:23:09.089 --> 00:23:10.122
(Lee Young) I know

524
00:23:10.691 --> 00:23:11.624
That's it

525
00:23:12.095 --> 00:23:14.213
Ha, I'm so busy

526
00:23:15.850 --> 00:23:17.635
I was so out of my mind that I didn’t even know

527
00:23:17.702 --> 00:23:20.099
Anyway, it's still off.
Even in front of the patient

528
00:23:20.767 --> 00:23:21.934
sorry

529
00:23:23.283 --> 00:23:24.303
But

530
00:23:24.905 --> 00:23:26.272
(Lee Young) I made a mistake

531
00:23:26.965 --> 00:23:28.685
The intern teacher also scolded me.

532
00:23:28.752 --> 00:23:30.066
Just say you can't do it all

533
00:23:30.133 --> 00:23:31.675
If I couldn't do it, I would have stayed quiet.

534
00:23:31.742 --> 00:23:34.981
I was embarrassed because I couldn't do it.
You say things like this and that.

535
00:23:35.048 --> 00:23:36.450
And who won't scold me?

536
00:23:36.517 --> 00:23:38.752
If you're going to scold me, call me separately.
I have to scold them one-on-one.

537
00:23:38.819 --> 00:23:40.353
I was pissed at that time

538
00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:41.687
I didn't have the presence of mind to do that.

539
00:23:46.801 --> 00:23:48.801
[Calm music]

540
00:23:50.197 --> 00:23:51.100
Because of Teacher Oh I-young

541
00:23:51.167 --> 00:23:53.732
Patients to Dr. Tak Gion
You don't want to be treated

542
00:23:54.234 --> 00:23:56.703
(Dowon) Already in the gynecological ward
There must have been rumors

543
00:23:56.770 --> 00:23:58.404
You're an intern, huh?

544
00:23:59.239 --> 00:24:01.273
Intern who has been in the hospital for less than three months

545
00:24:03.677 --> 00:24:05.078
sorry

546
00:24:05.145 --> 00:24:06.478
Can't you stand it when you're angry?

547
00:24:08.115 --> 00:24:09.516
Do you have to pour it all out to get rid of your anger?

548
00:24:09.583 --> 00:24:10.816
- Yes
- (Dowon) Hey!

549
00:24:14.655 --> 00:24:15.856
[light sigh]

550
00:24:15.923 --> 00:24:18.008
No, I'll fix it.

551
00:24:21.061 --> 00:24:22.463
[sigh]

552
00:24:41.515 --> 00:24:43.015
(Dowon) You didn’t press it.

553
00:24:44.694 --> 00:24:45.818
(Lee Young) Ah

554
00:24:46.767 --> 00:24:47.820
[Dowon’s light sigh]

555
00:24:48.455 --> 00:24:49.889
(Dowon) You must be very tired.

556
00:24:53.360 --> 00:24:56.290
I just raised my voice a little bit.

557
00:24:57.164 --> 00:24:58.264
I'm sorry, are you mad?

558
00:25:00.100 --> 00:25:01.367
It's not something to be angry about.

559
00:25:02.769 --> 00:25:04.803
It's not something the in-laws should feel sorry for.

560
00:25:06.907 --> 00:25:08.146
I deserved to be scolded.

561
00:25:09.643 --> 00:25:11.344
I also apologized to the intern.

562
00:25:11.411 --> 00:25:12.546
(Dowon) Well done

563
00:25:12.613 --> 00:25:14.481
Well done, I see you sometimes

564
00:25:14.548 --> 00:25:16.749
Surprisingly, my in-laws had a concept.

565
00:25:21.822 --> 00:25:23.955
Wow, it's already past 12 o'clock

566
00:25:27.928 --> 00:25:28.795
[Lee Young’s surprised gasp]

567
00:25:28.862 --> 00:25:30.096
It's really past 12 o'clock

568
00:25:30.163 --> 00:25:31.997
Why, are you Snow White?

569
00:25:34.234 --> 00:25:35.626
(Dowon) Is it Cinderella?

570
00:25:36.222 --> 00:25:39.106
It's not even one or two days that it's past 12 o'clock
What are you so surprised about?

571
00:25:39.173 --> 00:25:40.372
It's my birthday today

572
00:25:43.143 --> 00:25:44.910
(Lee Young) May 20th, Oh Lee Young

573
00:25:46.113 --> 00:25:47.313
No, the name...

574
00:25:48.415 --> 00:25:50.082
That's how they do it too

575
00:25:51.952 --> 00:25:53.352
Oh, happy birthday.

576
00:25:55.822 --> 00:25:58.624
(Lee Young) You live in the same house and don’t even know your birthday?

577
00:26:00.127 --> 00:26:01.360
I'm sorry, I originally

578
00:26:01.844 --> 00:26:03.200
I don't usually celebrate other people's birthdays.

579
00:26:03.267 --> 00:26:05.065
Especially since I am a virgin in-law.

580
00:26:05.132 --> 00:26:07.032
Tell me what you want
I'll buy it for you

581
00:26:09.536 --> 00:26:11.036
- Really?
- (Dowon) Yes

582
00:26:14.208 --> 00:26:15.941
Then don't give me a gift.

583
00:26:17.311 --> 00:26:18.711
Can't you just grant me one wish?

584
00:26:20.412 --> 00:26:22.702
Well... listen to it.

585
00:26:22.769 --> 00:26:23.817
Oh, will you just do it?

586
00:26:23.884 --> 00:26:25.085
[Dowon’s laughter]

587
00:26:25.152 --> 00:26:26.318
(Dowon) Okay, I will do it.

588
00:26:28.522 --> 00:26:30.090
Just until I get home

589
00:26:30.157 --> 00:26:33.325
(Lee Young) So, just until you reach the 14th floor.

590
00:26:34.061 --> 00:26:35.580
Just say ‘yes’

591
00:26:38.198 --> 00:26:39.999
[Elevator arrival sound]
[lively music]

592
00:26:42.269 --> 00:26:43.369
[Elevator button sound]

593
00:26:44.471 --> 00:26:45.804
What are you doing, not riding?

594
00:26:56.757 --> 00:26:58.717
- Buy me food.
- Yes

595
00:27:01.048 --> 00:27:02.087
Cold ginseng

596
00:27:03.138 --> 00:27:06.892
(Do-won) Next weekend, my brother and sister-in-law
You decided to eat it, then I will buy it.

597
00:27:08.795 --> 00:27:09.828
(Lee Young) Mr...

598
00:27:15.836 --> 00:27:17.169
Let's watch a movie

599
00:27:18.005 --> 00:27:19.038
yes

600
00:27:19.773 --> 00:27:20.941
(Dowon) Friday night

601
00:27:21.008 --> 00:27:23.842
I'll set up Netflix and beer.
Come out to the living room

602
00:27:25.910 --> 00:27:26.879
[Lee Young’s amazed exclamation]

603
00:27:29.283 --> 00:27:30.416
9

604
00:27:31.852 --> 00:27:32.985
10

605
00:27:37.101 --> 00:27:38.123
11

606
00:27:41.995 --> 00:27:43.962
Can I like it?

607
00:27:47.567 --> 00:27:49.567
[Soft music]

608
00:28:18.797 --> 00:28:21.533
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

609
00:28:23.470 --> 00:28:24.470
yes

610
00:28:25.005 --> 00:28:26.205
[Elevator arrival sound]

611
00:28:39.238 --> 00:28:41.253
If you want to be uncomfortable with me

612
00:28:43.690 --> 00:28:44.690
I do that

613
00:28:49.933 --> 00:28:51.631
[Door lock button sound]

614
00:28:51.698 --> 00:28:53.432
[Door lock operating sound]
[Sound of door opening]

615
00:28:54.133 --> 00:28:56.300
[Sound of door closing]
[Door lock operating sound]

616
00:28:58.537 --> 00:29:00.537
[bird chirping]

617
00:29:08.114 --> 00:29:09.583
Just go a little late today

618
00:29:09.650 --> 00:29:10.749
we have something to do

619
00:29:11.952 --> 00:29:13.185
[Monk's yawn]

620
00:29:14.121 --> 00:29:16.121
[Calm music]

621
00:29:16.890 --> 00:29:21.361
[Happy birthday music]
(Jooyoung) ♪ Happy birthday ♪

622
00:29:21.428 --> 00:29:25.373
♪ Happy birthday ♪

623
00:29:25.440 --> 00:29:27.432
♪ My beloved in-laws ♪

624
00:29:27.499 --> 00:29:29.806
- (Jooyoung) ♪ My little brother ♪
- (Seungwon) ♪ Sister-in-law ♪

625
00:29:29.873 --> 00:29:33.273
(Together) ♪ Happy birthday ♪

626
00:29:33.340 --> 00:29:35.423
[Jooyoung cheers]

627
00:29:35.490 --> 00:29:37.051
[Soft music]
(Jooyoung) French, French, French

628
00:29:37.118 --> 00:29:38.078
[Lee Young’s mouth blowing]

629
00:29:38.145 --> 00:29:39.428
(Jooyoung) Happy birthday

630
00:29:39.495 --> 00:29:40.879
(Dowon) Happy birthday

631
00:29:41.715 --> 00:29:44.182
Haam, what morning is the birthday party starting?

632
00:29:44.249 --> 00:29:46.254
You never know when both of you will come home at night.

633
00:29:46.321 --> 00:29:48.321
Still, it's my birthday, so I should eat seaweed soup.

634
00:29:48.388 --> 00:29:49.389
Did you take a picture?

635
00:29:49.456 --> 00:29:50.767
I have to send it to my father-in-law.

636
00:29:50.834 --> 00:29:51.857
(Jooyoung) Oh, that’s right

637
00:29:56.763 --> 00:29:58.634
[camera shutter sound]

638
00:29:58.701 --> 00:30:00.300
(Jooyoung) Hey, smile, smile

639
00:30:00.367 --> 00:30:02.434
Ah, pretty

640
00:30:02.501 --> 00:30:04.167
[camera shutter sound]

641
00:30:04.234 --> 00:30:06.867
I need to show some courtesy to my dad.

642
00:30:06.934 --> 00:30:09.933
Instead of mom and dad
He prepared a table for his younger brother's birthday.

643
00:30:10.000 --> 00:30:11.767
Did your sister do it? My brother-in-law did it

644
00:30:11.834 --> 00:30:13.580
Sister-in-law, how did you know?

645
00:30:13.647 --> 00:30:15.715
It's delicious, the seasoning is just right.
[cell phone ringing sound]

646
00:30:15.782 --> 00:30:16.915
[Seungwon’s thrilled exclamation]

647
00:30:17.417 --> 00:30:19.384
Yeah, did you see the picture?

648
00:30:19.853 --> 00:30:21.053
[Bright laughter]

649
00:30:21.788 --> 00:30:22.856
They say happy birthday

650
00:30:22.923 --> 00:30:23.884
thanks

651
00:30:23.951 --> 00:30:25.025
(Jooyoung) He looks like his mom

652
00:30:25.092 --> 00:30:27.125
You like seaweed soup with a lot of meat in it.

653
00:30:28.210 --> 00:30:30.297
My son-in-law cooked it well.

654
00:30:30.364 --> 00:30:32.299
Father-in-law, how are you?

655
00:30:32.366 --> 00:30:34.633
I am taking good care of Sister Young.

656
00:30:35.435 --> 00:30:37.436
(Jooyoung) Oh, dad, are you doing well at work?

657
00:30:38.105 --> 00:30:39.966
Uncle Cheolmin, we are not friends anymore

658
00:30:40.033 --> 00:30:41.341
You're the boss

659
00:30:41.408 --> 00:30:42.941
Learn well from below

660
00:30:45.379 --> 00:30:47.646
Stop saying you're sorry

661
00:30:48.348 --> 00:30:50.649
Thanks to his dad's failure, he came to his senses, well.

662
00:30:51.151 --> 00:30:52.452
Yeah

663
00:30:52.519 --> 00:30:54.393
I'll go to Busan sometime, uh.

664
00:30:54.460 --> 00:30:55.567
Oh, wait a minute.

665
00:30:55.634 --> 00:30:56.723
Hey

666
00:30:56.790 --> 00:30:58.323
Hey, hey

667
00:31:00.501 --> 00:31:01.526
(Lee Young) Oh

668
00:31:02.834 --> 00:31:03.862
uh?

669
00:31:04.765 --> 00:31:06.133
uh

670
00:31:06.200 --> 00:31:07.966
Yeah, okay

671
00:31:08.563 --> 00:31:09.530
uh

672
00:31:11.104 --> 00:31:12.306
(Jooyoung) Ah...

673
00:31:13.340 --> 00:31:14.539
I ate well
[Call end tone]

674
00:31:15.142 --> 00:31:16.808
- (Seungwon) Did you eat everything?
- (Dowon) Yes

675
00:31:21.148 --> 00:31:22.249
I'll be back

676
00:31:22.316 --> 00:31:23.315
(Seungwon) Take care

677
00:31:25.652 --> 00:31:28.253
[Sound of door opening]
Does everyone have any birthday presents?

678
00:31:28.320 --> 00:31:29.656
(Seungwon) Ah, a gift

679
00:31:29.723 --> 00:31:31.490
[Sound of door closing]
I don't know what my sister-in-law would like.

680
00:31:32.292 --> 00:31:33.567
I put it in my bank account

681
00:31:33.634 --> 00:31:36.161
I don't know, but my brother-in-law knows me best.

682
00:31:37.253 --> 00:31:38.630
Thank you, brother-in-law.

683
00:31:41.227 --> 00:31:42.695
A couple is one body

684
00:31:42.762 --> 00:31:43.869
A gift too

685
00:31:49.443 --> 00:31:50.575
[Lee Young sighs]

686
00:31:51.278 --> 00:31:52.913
Oh, happy birthday Lee Young!
[Sound of door closing]

687
00:31:52.980 --> 00:31:54.901
(Namkyung) Happy birthday, Talk said.

688
00:31:54.968 --> 00:31:57.017
(Sabi) Don’t tell me in advance
Congratulations, Lee Young-ah!

689
00:31:57.084 --> 00:31:59.922
(Lee Young) Thank you
[Mobile phone ringing continuously]

690
00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:05.859
(Japan) Happy Birthday to You

691
00:32:05.926 --> 00:32:07.700
Hey, I didn't have time to go buy a gift.

692
00:32:07.767 --> 00:32:08.734
Let's party properly next time

693
00:32:08.801 --> 00:32:10.801
[lively music]

694
00:32:13.127 --> 00:32:14.000
(Nanjing) Live livestock

695
00:32:14.067 --> 00:32:15.701
That's the most popular scent.

696
00:32:16.603 --> 00:32:17.604
[Sound of door opening]

697
00:32:17.671 --> 00:32:19.088
(Sabi) Lee Young-ah, happy birthday
[Sound of door closing]

698
00:32:19.934 --> 00:32:22.641
I don't know what you like yet
congratulations

699
00:32:24.711 --> 00:32:26.746
[Sound of door opening and closing]

700
00:32:26.813 --> 00:32:29.541
Ah, in times like this, it works well again.
[Sound of putting down cell phone]

701
00:32:31.485 --> 00:32:33.002
(Mother 2) That’s right, isn’t it?

702
00:32:37.824 --> 00:32:38.801
That's it

703
00:32:38.868 --> 00:32:40.100
(Mother 2) It’s your daughter, right?

704
00:32:40.167 --> 00:32:43.534
I heard that fetal dreams and pear shapes are real, right?

705
00:32:43.601 --> 00:32:46.331
(Jae-il) I’m keeping my legs closed
It's vague, though.

706
00:32:47.376 --> 00:32:48.435
He's like a son

707
00:32:48.502 --> 00:32:49.534
No!

708
00:32:49.601 --> 00:32:51.069
That can't be happening

709
00:32:51.701 --> 00:32:52.671
Are you sure?

710
00:32:53.300 --> 00:32:54.939
yes
[Mother 2’s sigh]

711
00:32:55.006 --> 00:32:58.901
(Mother 2) Teacher, I want to take a look at that daughter.

712
00:32:58.968 --> 00:33:01.515
I'm struggling at the age of 44.

713
00:33:01.582 --> 00:33:02.814
please look again

714
00:33:03.684 --> 00:33:04.683
[Mother 2’s sigh]

715
00:33:05.367 --> 00:33:06.686
That's right son

716
00:33:06.753 --> 00:33:08.555
I’m good at looking at gender.

717
00:33:08.622 --> 00:33:10.134
You didn't see it wrong, did you?

718
00:33:10.201 --> 00:33:11.258
kicking it

719
00:33:11.325 --> 00:33:14.092
[Emphasized sound effect]
It's definitely different from their time.

720
00:33:19.400 --> 00:33:20.867
That's right

721
00:33:20.934 --> 00:33:22.434
(Japan) Write...

722
00:33:22.501 --> 00:33:24.667
Oh, of course, mother.

723
00:33:24.734 --> 00:33:26.300
I guess I'll just check it one last time.

724
00:33:26.367 --> 00:33:27.672
- (Mother 2) Oh, yes.
- Yes

725
00:33:28.667 --> 00:33:29.674
(Japan) Teacher

726
00:33:30.267 --> 00:33:31.767
Again, again?

727
00:33:31.834 --> 00:33:33.947
Okay, just check.

728
00:33:34.014 --> 00:33:35.981
[Embarrassed laughter]
[light music]

729
00:33:38.133 --> 00:33:39.418
[cell phone vibrating sound]

730
00:33:43.868 --> 00:33:45.325
maternal body

731
00:33:45.392 --> 00:33:46.534
That's right son

732
00:33:46.601 --> 00:33:48.660
(Jae-il) Right? Oh, that's right!

733
00:33:48.727 --> 00:33:50.767
(Mother 2) Oh, you’re not really your daughter?

734
00:33:50.834 --> 00:33:54.000
(Eunmi) Yes, just as the teacher said here.
He's my real son

735
00:33:54.067 --> 00:33:55.166
[Mother 2’s lament]

736
00:33:55.233 --> 00:33:58.472
(Mother 2) Oh, what should I do?
Four sons, oh, what should I do?

737
00:33:58.539 --> 00:34:00.340
[Mother 2’s crying sound]

738
00:34:00.407 --> 00:34:03.176
(Eunmi) When raising
Even though it may be difficult, if you have many brothers,

739
00:34:03.243 --> 00:34:05.467
It's also fun and good, isn't it?

740
00:34:05.534 --> 00:34:07.634
Yes, and if you are the youngest

741
00:34:07.701 --> 00:34:09.634
You must have a lot of charm like me.

742
00:34:09.701 --> 00:34:10.916
That's it!

743
00:34:11.752 --> 00:34:15.322
(Taerim) [Laughing] Ah, still
The child is healthy

744
00:34:15.389 --> 00:34:16.655
Thank you for your hard work

745
00:34:17.291 --> 00:34:18.390
[Mother 2’s sigh]

746
00:34:20.928 --> 00:34:22.662
(Jaeil) The mother was very excited.

747
00:34:22.729 --> 00:34:24.097
Just in case

748
00:34:24.164 --> 00:34:26.066
(Eunmi) Oh, I can see the gender clearly now.

749
00:34:26.133 --> 00:34:28.300
(Jaeil) Yes, I really got the idea.

750
00:34:28.367 --> 00:34:29.434
(Eunmi) So

751
00:34:29.968 --> 00:34:31.634
Hey, congratulations

752
00:34:31.701 --> 00:34:33.400
Uh, let's not see each other again today.

753
00:34:33.467 --> 00:34:35.006
- Hey, I'm leaving.
- (Residing in Japan) Yes

754
00:34:35.734 --> 00:34:36.775
thank you

755
00:34:37.634 --> 00:34:38.643
Yes!

756
00:34:39.813 --> 00:34:41.181
(Minjun) Mom!

757
00:34:41.248 --> 00:34:43.817
Ah, release the wifi!

758
00:34:43.884 --> 00:34:48.388
Oh, quick, the game is being broadcast now!

759
00:34:48.455 --> 00:34:50.156
(Lee Young) When I checked the video

760
00:34:50.223 --> 00:34:51.823
Fortunately, the cancer didn't appear to have spread much.

761
00:34:51.890 --> 00:34:54.327
- (Minjun) Oh, quick!
- The surgery won't take long.

762
00:34:54.394 --> 00:34:56.596
- (Minjun) Now!
- (Sejin) Boy...

763
00:34:56.663 --> 00:34:58.667
(Lee Young) When the biopsy results come out after surgery,

764
00:34:58.734 --> 00:35:00.064
- (Minjun) Right now
- (Lee Young) What type of cancer is it?

765
00:35:00.131 --> 00:35:02.404
I'll tell you the exact stage.

766
00:35:02.471 --> 00:35:05.604
- (Minjun) Oh, quickly.
- (Sejin) Hey, just stay still.

767
00:35:05.671 --> 00:35:08.267
You need to walk a lot after surgery.
There are no intestinal adhesions.

768
00:35:08.334 --> 00:35:10.734
- (Minjun) Mom!
- Thrombosis is especially common in the legs.

769
00:35:10.801 --> 00:35:12.810
- Even if you lie down and tap your feet
- (Minjun) Oh, quick!

770
00:35:12.877 --> 00:35:13.901
It's better if you do a lot.

771
