1279
00:58:44.567 --> 00:58:45.734
Ah...

1280
00:58:45.801 --> 00:58:48.328
Huh? I guess no one is going to come in now?

1281
00:58:48.395 --> 00:58:49.496
Yeah, so

1282
00:58:49.563 --> 00:58:52.667
I just begged my fellow teacher and the two of us did it.

1283
00:58:52.734 --> 00:58:53.700
Just the two of you?

1284
00:58:53.767 --> 00:58:56.800
(Jaehwi) Yes, but
Well, I also have a laparoscope.

1285
00:58:58.785 --> 00:59:00.470
Is it three?
[Jaehwi’s laughter]

1286
00:59:04.067 --> 00:59:05.075
Then

1287
00:59:06.200 --> 00:59:07.477
Even me...

1288
00:59:09.968 --> 00:59:10.914
no

1289
00:59:11.868 --> 00:59:12.719
Still...

1290
00:59:12.786 --> 00:59:14.734
(Jaehwi) Hey, don’t do that, you don’t have to.

1291
00:59:14.801 --> 00:59:17.587
- You can visit next time.
- Really?

1292
00:59:17.654 --> 00:59:21.115
Write, ah, but
Am I really, really okay?

1293
00:59:23.030 --> 00:59:24.890
No, I'm a bit sorry

1294
00:59:31.400 --> 00:59:32.669
Then...

1295
00:59:32.736 --> 00:59:33.500
Then

1296
00:59:33.567 --> 00:59:36.206
I'll go, good luck
[Program operation sound effect]

1297
00:59:36.907 --> 00:59:37.940
(Jaehwi) Ah, ah, ah...

1298
00:59:38.007 --> 00:59:38.979
Oh, you're going?

1299
00:59:39.046 --> 00:59:40.000
Uh, okay, go.

1300
00:59:40.067 --> 00:59:41.111
[Program operation sound effect]

1301
00:59:41.968 --> 00:59:43.467
(Dowon) I’m sorry, Professor.

1302
00:59:43.534 --> 00:59:45.115
These are not the kids who will miss that today.

1303
00:59:45.182 --> 00:59:47.629
There was a lot of work in the ward and delivery room.

1304
00:59:50.290 --> 00:59:52.145
No, I will scold you well.

1305
00:59:56.730 --> 00:59:57.895
yes sorry

1306
00:59:59.801 --> 01:00:00.864
[Call end sound]

1307
01:00:01.968 --> 01:00:04.167
[Sound of approaching footsteps]

1308
01:00:04.234 --> 01:00:05.605
(Japan) Knock knock

1309
01:00:05.672 --> 01:00:06.936
Teacher?

1310
01:00:07.003 --> 01:00:09.033
(Dowon) Wow, I just remembered coffee.

1311
01:00:09.100 --> 01:00:10.300
I knew you would

1312
01:00:10.367 --> 01:00:11.344
I prepared it with the biggest one.

1313
01:00:11.411 --> 01:00:12.909
(Dowon) Sseu-eup, wait a minute.

1314
01:00:14.300 --> 01:00:15.333
Would you like to see another ultrasound?

1315
01:00:15.400 --> 01:00:16.379
no

1316
01:00:16.446 --> 01:00:17.984
I can see the ultrasound well now.

1317
01:00:18.051 --> 01:00:20.884
Wow, this is the nicest thing I heard today.

1318
01:00:21.488 --> 01:00:24.801
(Japanese) Gender, cervical length
Biometry, amniotic fluid volume

1319
01:00:24.868 --> 01:00:25.834
Take care of everything

1320
01:00:25.901 --> 01:00:28.825
Write, ultrasound is now in the first year.

1321
01:00:28.892 --> 01:00:30.060
Should I see it best?

1322
01:00:31.267 --> 01:00:32.662
(Dowon) Isn’t that enough?

1323
01:00:33.767 --> 01:00:34.767
no way!

1324
01:00:34.834 --> 01:00:37.204
No, sir.
I said I did really well today?

1325
01:00:37.271 --> 01:00:38.738
Okay

1326
01:00:38.805 --> 01:00:40.167
(Jae-il) Is it true?

1327
01:00:40.234 --> 01:00:42.375
With teacher Eunmi
Teacher Dahye also saw it.

1328
01:00:42.442 --> 01:00:43.615
He also said he was good at it.

1329
01:00:45.467 --> 01:00:47.210
- Eunmi and Dahye?
- (Residing in Japan) Yes

1330
01:00:48.133 --> 01:00:51.267
After I saw everything
How many times did you come last time to check?

1331
01:00:51.334 --> 01:00:53.567
Yesterday and today, every time you come and check

1332
01:00:53.634 --> 01:00:55.000
All correct

1333
01:00:55.067 --> 01:00:56.901
I really got all A today

1334
01:00:56.968 --> 01:00:58.225
Write it

1335
01:00:58.292 --> 01:00:59.893
This is enough

1336
01:00:59.960 --> 01:01:01.925
I think I did better than Namgyeong.

1337
01:01:04.731 --> 01:01:06.800
(Dowon) The diagnosis was correct.
I'm so glad

1338
01:01:06.867 --> 01:01:08.569
I don’t think that’s what’s important, right?

1339
01:01:09.667 --> 01:01:10.700
yes?

1340
01:01:10.767 --> 01:01:12.333
Because I am not confident in my own judgment.

1341
01:01:12.400 --> 01:01:15.138
In the end, I want you to cover it
Didn’t you solve it by calling your seniors?

1342
01:01:15.709 --> 01:01:16.677
Uh...

1343
01:01:17.634 --> 01:01:19.576
(Dowon) Eunmi and Dahye
They're usually busy kids.

1344
01:01:20.714 --> 01:01:22.300
But I had to go to the ultrasound room because of you.

1345
01:01:22.367 --> 01:01:24.481
Yesterday and today must have been crazy busy and difficult?

1346
01:01:26.801 --> 01:01:27.918
That's a nuisance

1347
01:01:28.634 --> 01:01:30.587
you were right, good job
I think you're mistaken

1348
01:01:30.654 --> 01:01:31.788
no one thinks that way

1349
01:01:31.855 --> 01:01:33.990
Everyone else is doing it too, that's amazing.

1350
01:01:34.567 --> 01:01:35.562
[Calm music]

1351
01:01:35.629 --> 01:01:38.400
Because I don't want to take responsibility
Making someone else inbulb

1352
01:01:38.467 --> 01:01:40.063
Taking other people's time

1353
01:01:40.931 --> 01:01:42.365
That's incompetent

1354
01:01:44.571 --> 01:01:47.140
What is the right thing to do going forward?
think about it carefully

1355
01:01:53.280 --> 01:01:54.457
[Jaeil’s sigh]

1356
01:01:58.100 --> 01:01:59.933
Placenta previa is too severe

1357
01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:01.822
If there is a large fibroid in front of the uterus

1358
01:02:01.889 --> 01:02:04.889
To avoid that, use Uterrain Incision.
With Jay Shape...

1359
01:02:04.956 --> 01:02:06.256
Lee Young-ah, are you dead?

1360
01:02:07.160 --> 01:02:09.253
Mental stepper, huh?

1361
01:02:10.097 --> 01:02:12.429
This is what the professor told you
I told you to tell me everything

1362
01:02:12.496 --> 01:02:15.532
Hey, you haven't seen this surgery either.
Are you listening?

1363
01:02:16.241 --> 01:02:17.933
(Sabi) Are you not going to study?

1364
01:02:18.000 --> 01:02:20.100
I'm studying this next week.

1365
01:02:20.167 --> 01:02:22.867
(Namkyung) Oh my
Why are you already worrying about next week?

1366
01:02:22.934 --> 01:02:24.133
Don't worry about tomorrow

1367
01:02:24.200 --> 01:02:25.909
- (Sabi) What is it?
- (Nanjing) Cookies

1368
01:02:28.400 --> 01:02:30.688
The mother gave it to me to say thank you.

1369
01:02:31.314 --> 01:02:33.016
Hey guys, let's eat cookies.

1370
01:02:33.901 --> 01:02:34.951
Hey, Bbangsuni

1371
01:02:35.018 --> 01:02:36.386
Do you hate cookies?

1372
01:02:55.442 --> 01:02:56.748
(Jae-il) Is your boyfriend going to last this long?

1373
01:02:57.367 --> 01:02:59.746
- What are you talking about?
- This time I won't contact you for quite some time.

1374
01:02:59.813 --> 01:03:02.300
[Bewildered] I'm your boyfriend
Aren't you waiting?

1375
01:03:02.367 --> 01:03:04.734
Is this waiting for a call to the delivery room?

1376
01:03:04.801 --> 01:03:05.966
Got it?

1377
01:03:06.033 --> 01:03:08.118
(Lee Young) Hey, do you only have one cookie?

1378
01:03:08.622 --> 01:03:09.941
(Nanjing) Buy it with your own money and eat it

1379
01:03:11.692 --> 01:03:12.947
i have no money

1380
01:03:14.591 --> 01:03:15.667
[sigh]

1381
01:03:15.734 --> 01:03:19.429
I'm greedy because I don't have money, it's sad

1382
01:03:23.904 --> 01:03:26.259
(Sabi) Still
It's been a long time since I've had a peaceful night, right?

1383
01:03:30.334 --> 01:03:33.443
It's quiet like this every day
I hope nothing bad happened

1384
01:03:35.901 --> 01:03:37.984
[Announcement sound]

1385
01:03:38.051 --> 01:03:39.753
(Announcement) Obstetrics and Gynecology Code Blue
[nervous music]

1386
01:03:39.820 --> 01:03:41.620
Obstetrics and Gynecology Code Blue

1387
01:03:41.687 --> 01:03:45.388
Ward 101, Room 1018, Obstetrics and Gynecology, Code Blue

1388
01:03:46.293 --> 01:03:49.796
Obstetrics and Gynecology Code Blue, Obstetrics and Gynecology Code Blue

1389
01:03:49.863 --> 01:03:51.631
Room 1018, Ward 101

1390
01:03:51.698 --> 01:03:54.200
[Jong-im’s heavy breathing]
Obstetrics and Gynecology Code Blue

1391
01:03:54.267 --> 01:03:55.667
(Nanjing) Please connect the line.

1392
01:03:55.734 --> 01:03:57.734
(Japan) Epinephrine.
Portable x-ray too.

1393
01:03:57.801 --> 01:03:59.436
(Sabi) ABGA please leave

1394
01:04:08.448 --> 01:04:10.528
[ECG meter beeping sound]

1395
01:04:17.501 --> 01:04:20.223
I had my vitals stable until this afternoon.

1396
01:04:21.267 --> 01:04:22.592
suddenly an hour ago

1397
01:04:23.067 --> 01:04:26.367
While appealing to Dyspnia and Chest Pain,
BP falling

1398
01:04:26.434 --> 01:04:27.764
(Lee Young) RR has risen

1399
01:04:28.834 --> 01:04:31.568
Then I couldn't get my vitals.
CPR was performed for 30 minutes.

1400
01:04:32.067 --> 01:04:33.903
After my vitals came back, I did an incubation.

1401
01:04:34.371 --> 01:04:36.206
Even if you use vasopressors, BP does not increase.

1402
01:04:37.067 --> 01:04:38.408
I was sent to the intensive care unit.

1403
01:04:42.649 --> 01:04:44.381
Suddenly...

1404
01:04:45.234 --> 01:04:46.983
(Lee Young) According to the chest CT scan,

1405
01:04:47.554 --> 01:04:49.152
Looks like pulmonary embolism

1406
01:04:49.790 --> 01:04:51.087
[Junmo’s sigh]

1407
01:04:52.167 --> 01:04:53.089
Who is the guardian?

1408
01:04:54.228 --> 01:04:55.352
He's outside.

1409
01:04:56.630 --> 01:04:58.557
- Let’s ask him to come.
- (Main lead) Yes

1410
01:05:02.699 --> 01:05:03.704
(Junmo) Um...

1411
01:05:05.300 --> 01:05:06.503
Mom

1412
01:05:07.407 --> 01:05:08.473
Now...

1413
01:05:08.976 --> 01:05:11.300
It's a little hard to breathe

1414
01:05:11.367 --> 01:05:13.243
My mom is not dead.

1415
01:05:15.378 --> 01:05:18.434
(Hyemin) Mom
I'm a sick person from the beginning

1416
01:05:18.501 --> 01:05:21.051
I've been in pain ever since I was born.

1417
01:05:24.124 --> 01:05:26.589
It's the same as the last time I got sick.

1418
01:05:27.968 --> 01:05:30.360
I was discharged from the hospital back then too, my mom.

1419
01:05:32.699 --> 01:05:33.829
[Junmo’s sigh]

1420
01:05:35.534 --> 01:05:38.268
But this time, uh...

1421
01:05:45.601 --> 01:05:46.676
[Junmo’s sigh]

1422
01:05:49.567 --> 01:05:50.642
[Junmo’s sigh]

1423
01:05:53.300 --> 01:05:54.600
Who is coming?

1424
01:05:54.667 --> 01:05:55.767
(Juyeon) Ah, yes

1425
01:05:55.834 --> 01:05:58.024
There is a foundation that the patient receives support from.

1426
01:05:58.091 --> 01:05:59.756
One person will come from there.

1427
01:06:00.634 --> 01:06:04.327
Mother prepares in advance
It seems like you've done a lot.

1428
01:06:05.199 --> 01:06:06.433
(Junmo) Oh, really?

1429
01:06:08.869 --> 01:06:10.800
Write, then
[Junmo’s sigh]

1430
01:06:11.328 --> 01:06:12.634
until you get there

1431
01:06:12.701 --> 01:06:14.237
Teacher Oh I-young is with me.

1432
01:06:16.200 --> 01:06:18.074
- Me?
- (Junmo) Yes, that...

1433
01:06:19.033 --> 01:06:21.310
What kids like
While eating ice cream

1434
01:06:21.377 --> 01:06:23.400
[Junmo takes a breath]

1435
01:06:23.467 --> 01:06:25.548
[Sighing] This and that...

1436
01:06:26.067 --> 01:06:27.600
please explain

1437
01:06:27.667 --> 01:06:28.952
Even if you are 10 years old

1438
01:06:30.834 --> 01:06:32.355
You're at the age where you know everything

1439
01:06:33.467 --> 01:06:35.491
Ah, yes

1440
01:06:35.558 --> 01:06:36.665
(Junmo) Oh, yeah

1441
01:06:45.014 --> 01:06:46.169
[sigh]

1442
01:06:58.754 --> 01:07:00.116
[Lee Young’s light sigh]

1443
01:07:01.755 --> 01:07:03.186
[Lee Young’s trembling breathing]

1444
01:07:08.934 --> 01:07:11.033
I think my mom is going to heaven

1445
01:07:11.100 --> 01:07:12.095
No

1446
01:07:13.333 --> 01:07:15.298
(Hyemin) Because the teacher doesn’t know

1447
01:07:16.234 --> 01:07:19.000
My mom was always in this much pain.

1448
01:07:19.067 --> 01:07:20.837
I was discharged from the hospital again.

1449
01:07:23.467 --> 01:07:24.741
It's real this time

1450
01:07:25.445 --> 01:07:26.481
This time mom

1451
01:07:28.200 --> 01:07:29.612
You're going to heaven

1452
01:07:30.784 --> 01:07:32.165
(Lee Young) I don’t have much time

1453
01:07:33.086 --> 01:07:35.805
So, I have to see my mom’s face a lot.

1454
01:07:37.234 --> 01:07:38.788
my mom really

1455
01:07:41.400 --> 01:07:42.707
Are you dying?

1456
01:07:49.570 --> 01:07:50.590
(Lee Young) Yes

1457
01:07:58.501 --> 01:08:01.110
[Hyemin’s crying]

1458
01:08:05.534 --> 01:08:06.983
Then I

1459
01:08:11.167 --> 01:08:12.422
What should I do?

1460
01:08:17.531 --> 01:08:19.062
i am not yet

1461
01:08:20.601 --> 01:08:21.831
Is it a child?

1462
01:08:22.532 --> 01:08:26.102
Where your mom will help you
He said he knew everyone.

1463
01:08:27.641 --> 01:08:28.745
He'll be back soon

1464
01:08:33.814 --> 01:08:35.545
[Hyemin’s trembling breathing]

1465
01:08:36.167 --> 01:08:38.047
[sad music]

1466
01:08:42.667 --> 01:08:45.755
Maybe tomorrow morning or early morning with mom

1467
01:08:50.430 --> 01:08:51.895
Can I say my last goodbye?

1468
01:08:53.730 --> 01:08:55.498
(Lee Young) Don’t say you won’t do it because you’re scared.

1469
01:08:56.501 --> 01:08:58.438
Say whatever you want to say to mom

1470
01:08:58.505 --> 01:09:02.100
[Crying sound]

1471
01:09:02.167 --> 01:09:03.172
and

1472
01:09:03.934 --> 01:09:07.076
Because I have a picture of my mom
I remember my mom’s face for a long time.

1473
01:09:09.501 --> 01:09:11.648
I forget my mom’s smell really quickly.

1474
01:09:13.000 --> 01:09:15.956
So things like mom’s clothes

1475
01:09:16.023 --> 01:09:17.636
I've had it for a long time
[Hyemin’s sigh]

1476
01:09:19.860 --> 01:09:20.857
Okay?

1477
01:09:32.206 --> 01:09:33.236
Uh...

1478
01:09:35.579 --> 01:09:37.986
The funeral is held for three days after someone dies?

1479
01:09:38.712 --> 01:09:40.509
The person coming will help you with that too.

1480
01:09:40.576 --> 01:09:41.577
you just need to know

1481
01:09:41.644 --> 01:09:43.383
[Hyemin’s crying]

1482
01:09:43.450 --> 01:09:44.480
(Hyemin) Yes...

1483
01:09:49.434 --> 01:09:51.087
don't cry anymore

1484
01:09:51.801 --> 01:09:53.723
(Lee Young) Be brave and kind

1485
01:09:54.868 --> 01:09:56.826
Eat well and study hard

1486
01:10:02.202 --> 01:10:03.201
says

1487
01:10:04.967 --> 01:10:07.675
Everyone who comes to the funeral
I'm going to tell you this

1488
01:10:09.643 --> 01:10:11.121
[shaking breathing]

1489
01:10:14.234 --> 01:10:15.478
It was like that to me too

1490
01:10:19.734 --> 01:10:21.734
[Sad Music-Continued]

1491
01:10:26.159 --> 01:10:27.448
I was in middle school

1492
01:10:27.995 --> 01:10:30.628
When I was in middle school, my mom became an angel in heaven.

1493
01:10:40.073 --> 01:10:41.511
But it doesn't work

1494
01:10:48.515 --> 01:10:50.813
I also want to be kind and courageous.

1495
01:10:53.654 --> 01:10:55.604
I shed tears at any time

1496
01:10:57.224 --> 01:10:58.621
I'm so angry

1497
01:11:00.194 --> 01:11:01.858
I'm so annoyed I don't even want to eat

1498
01:11:06.200 --> 01:11:09.127
But that's
It's not because I'm a bad kid.

1499
01:11:16.067 --> 01:11:17.340
When mom dies

1500
01:11:18.212 --> 01:11:21.689
Is there a hole like this in your chest?

1501
01:11:25.252 --> 01:11:27.450
I'm still there, so loud

1502
01:11:30.757 --> 01:11:32.321
That's why

1503
01:11:33.367 --> 01:11:34.824
Don't hide and cry

1504
01:11:36.129 --> 01:11:38.035
Don't pretend to smile when you're sad

1505
01:11:40.901 --> 01:11:42.398
Do whatever you want

1506
01:11:45.100 --> 01:11:46.102
Okay?

1507
01:12:00.821 --> 01:12:01.851
my phone number

1508
01:12:03.934 --> 01:12:07.156
Have a hard time
Contact me if you have any questions

1509
01:12:08.161 --> 01:12:09.253
You can do it every day

1510
01:12:11.331 --> 01:12:12.326
yes

1511
01:12:18.772 --> 01:12:20.169
[Hyemin’s trembling breathing]

1512
01:12:21.637 --> 01:12:24.077
[Sound of approaching footsteps]

1513
01:12:24.144 --> 01:12:25.252
(Jungwon) Hyemin?

1514
01:12:30.667 --> 01:12:31.948
(Lee Young) Who...

1515
01:12:32.815 --> 01:12:35.537
Hyemin was supporting her mother.
I'm from the foundation

1516
01:12:36.485 --> 01:12:38.588
(Jungwon) I also saw Hyemin often.

1517
01:12:39.255 --> 01:12:41.654
Ah, yes

1518
01:12:41.721 --> 01:12:44.047
You suddenly got worse?

1519
01:12:44.694 --> 01:12:47.296
Yes, you were scheduled for chemotherapy tomorrow.

1520
01:12:48.197 --> 01:12:50.737
Sudden multiple pulmonary embolisms

1521
01:12:50.804 --> 01:12:52.201
[sigh]

1522
01:12:57.644 --> 01:13:01.177
Then Hyemin
What happens next?

1523
01:13:02.567 --> 01:13:05.848
The relative my mother told me about earlier
are you coming now

1524
01:13:07.250 --> 01:13:08.388
We too

1525
01:13:08.455 --> 01:13:10.600
(Jungwon) We will continue to care for it from now on.
[sad music]

1526
01:13:10.667 --> 01:13:12.221
(Lee Young) Ah, yes...

1527
01:13:12.926 --> 01:13:13.881
thank you

1528
01:13:19.968 --> 01:13:21.767
Then I

1529
01:13:21.834 --> 01:13:22.799
(Garden) Yes

1530
01:13:33.200 --> 01:13:34.243
Shall we sit down?

1531
01:13:42.589 --> 01:13:43.817
Were you very surprised?

1532
01:13:44.734 --> 01:13:45.955
Are you in any pain?

1533
01:13:51.999 --> 01:13:53.093
I have a fever

1534
